# COMPONENT

## ViewCacheSample

### PACKAGE

org.sample.viewcache

### DESCRIPTION

Paged view-search sample for UI list rendering.

### SPECIFICATION

This component demonstrates that the primary UI list path is view search with paging.
The runtime line adds cache-aware chunk reuse for repeated nearby pages.

# ENTITY

## Person

### DESCRIPTION

Person record used as the source entity for paged view search.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| city  | string   | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |

### VIEW

- VIEWS :: summary
- REBUILDABLE :: true

#### DESCRIPTION

The view line is shaped for repeated list access with nearby offsets.

#### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| city  | string   | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |

#### QUERY

##### searchByCity

- EXPRESSION :: person.city == query.city
